# Read by ripgrep (Claude Code Grep/Glob, VS Code search) only — git ignores this file's rules.
# Keeps code searches fast and free of vendored, minified, binary, or generated noise.

# Vendored front-end plugins and build artifacts
/public/adminlte/plugins/
/public/vendor/
*.min.js
*.min.css
*.map

# Binary documents dropped into public/
/public/**/*.pptx
/public/**/*.pdf
/public/**/*.docx

# Generated knowledge-graph dumps (query docs/knowledge-graph/*.md instead)
/docs/knowledge-graph/*.jsonl

# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
